1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,680
Every cup begins on one misty hill.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,680
My grandfather planted these trees.

3
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,730
Each spring, the slope turns white.

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,220
Then the cherries blush red.

5
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,050
Picked by hand. Dried in the sun.

6
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:26,830
So every cup tastes of our hill.
